# EU5 regents: the ruler moves his landless regent to his court (set_employer) and
# then designates him regent (vanilla recipe from
# events/bookmark_events.txt: designate_diarch + try_start_diarchy = regency).
# Written from eu5_politics.json countries[].regent; regents who hold land
# elsewhere and are not vassals of the country are excluded.

